&lt;p&gt;Please note that we welcome interest from candidates with varying levels of experience; many successful candidates do not meet every single requirement. Additionally, studies have shown that people from &lt;a href=&quot;https://about.gitlab.com/company/culture/inclusion/#examples-of-select-underrepresented-groups&quot;&gt;underrepresented groups&lt;/a&gt; are less likely to apply to a job unless they meet every single qualification. If you&#39;re excited about this role, please apply and allow our recruiters to assess your application.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Country Hiring Guidelines: &lt;/strong&gt;GitLab hires new team members in countries around the world. All of our roles are remote, however some roles may carry specific location-based eligibility requirements. Our Talent Acquisition team can help answer any questions about location after starting the recruiting process.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Privacy Policy: &lt;/strong&gt;Please review our &lt;a href=&quot;https://handbook.gitlab.com/handbook/hiring/candidate-faq/recruitment-privacy-policy/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Recruitment Privacy Policy.&lt;/a&gt; Your privacy is important to us.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;GitLab is proud to be an equal opportunity workplace and is an affirmative action employer. GitLab’s policies and practices relating to recruitment, employment, career development and advancement, promotion, and retirement are based solely on merit, regardless of race, color, religion, ancestry, sex (including pregnancy, lactation, sexual orientation, gender identity, or gender expression), national origin, age, citizenship, marital status, mental or physical disability, genetic information (including family medical history), discharge status from the military, protected veteran status (which includes disabled veterans, recently separated veterans, active duty wartime or campaign badge veterans, and Armed Forces service medal veterans), or any other basis protected by law. GitLab will not tolerate discrimination or harassment based on any of these characteristics. See also&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://about.gitlab.com/handbook/people-policies/inc-usa/#equal-employment-opportunity-policy&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;GitLab’s EEO Policy&lt;/a&gt;&amp;nbsp;and&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://about.gitlab.com/handbook/labor-and-employment-notices/#eeoc-us-equal-employment-opportunity-commission-notices&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;EEO is the Law&lt;/a&gt;. If you have a disability or special need that requires&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://about.gitlab.com/handbook/people-policies/inc-usa/#reasonable-accommodation&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;accommodation&lt;/a&gt;, please let us know during the&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://about.gitlab.com/handbook/hiring/interviewing/#adjustments-to-our-interview-process&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;recruiting process&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Please note that we will never request payment or bank account information at any stage of the recruitment process. As we continue to grow our teams, we urge you to be cautious of fraudulent job postings or recruitment activities that misuse our company name and information. Please protect your personal information during any recruitment process. While Monks may contact potential candidates via LinkedIn, all applications must be submitted through our official website (&lt;a class=&quot;c-link c-link--focus-visible&quot; href=&quot;http://monks.com/careers&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; data-stringify-link=&quot;http://monks.com/careers&quot; data-sk=&quot;tooltip_parent&quot;&gt;monks.com/careers&lt;/a&gt;).&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;We&#39;re looking for a seasoned creative with a sharp eye and a strong command of generative AI, someone who doesn&#39;t just prompt, but&amp;nbsp;&lt;em&gt;crafts&lt;/em&gt;. Below two films are a good reference. We are looking for a person who is a good storyteller, who can make shots look natural and AI characters look human. Good attention to detail, and integrate imperfections to bring in more realism.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The candidates must have some software skills (ideally background in compositing. vfx or minimum editing).&amp;nbsp; The ability to elevate the AI output further is mandatory. The eye for good looking frames (colour tone, grading, art direction) is required. This is a senior position.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you&#39;ll do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Concept and produce AI-generated content across static and moving image for multi-platform publishing&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Take raw AI output and elevate it to publication-ready quality through skilled post-intervention and refinement&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate fluidly across multiple concurrent projects and creative teams&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Stay ahead of global trends, tools, and aesthetic benchmarks in AI-driven visual culture&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you bring&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A portfolio that demonstrates genuine range compelling AI stills &lt;em&gt;and&lt;/em&gt; film/video work&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deep, hands-on fluency with leading generative AI tools (image, video, and beyond)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;An instinctive, trained eye for quality, composition, and visual storytelling&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;The craft to know when AI output is almost there and the skill to take it the rest of the way&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Clear, confident communication; you can articulate creative decisions and take direction equally well&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A proactive mindset - you bring ideas, flag opportunities, and don&#39;t wait to be told&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What&#39;s expected&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experienced professional level. This is not an entry-level role&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You follow the global conversation around AI aesthetics and visual innovation closely&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You hold your own work to a high standard, every time.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Tools&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Aftereffects/Nuke, Photoshop&amp;nbsp; or Equal. (This will give us the confidence that they can elevate the AI output in post)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;3D software (Good to have, not mandatory)]&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;AI Tools:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Must know all the strength and weaknesses of Generative Models.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Must be fluent with Video Generative Tools and construction of prompts.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Workspace creation (Magnific Space, ComfyUI, Figma Weave) is a plus.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Portfolio:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;This is AI production first and hence we will keep our eyes out for pureplay AI output.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Candidate must have AI films that shows scene continuity.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Must have atleast done product ads.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Candidate must have consistent looking characters, product proof in their portfolio.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Have atleast one published AI film (done for a brand, approved and released).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Reference of work done by Monks:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=464AACUHbGU&quot;&gt;https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=464AACUHbGU&lt;/a&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://monks.slateapp.com/work/adforum-ask-maud-cannes-launch-film&quot;&gt;https://monks.slateapp.com/work/adforum-ask-maud-cannes-launch-film&lt;/a&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;PDq2pG_selectionAnchorContainer&quot; data-start=&quot;81&quot; data-end=&quot;303&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;81&quot; data-end=&quot;97&quot;&gt;Please note:&lt;/strong&gt; This is an evergreen talent pool posting and is &lt;strong data-start=&quot;146&quot; data-end=&quot;178&quot;&gt;not for an immediate opening&lt;/strong&gt;. We&#39;re building a network of talented AI Generative Artists for upcoming freelance and project-based opportunities at Monks.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;308&quot; data-end=&quot;608&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;As new client projects arise—which happens frequently—we&#39;ll review applications from this talent pool and reach out to candidates whose skills and experience best match the project requirements. If there&#39;s a strong fit and you&#39;re available, we&#39;ll share the project details and discuss the next steps.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;613&quot; data-end=&quot;783&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;If you&#39;re excited about working with Monks on cutting-edge AI creative projects, we&#39;d love to hear from you and keep your profile in our network for future opportunities.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;#LI-Remote&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Monks &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Monks is the global, digital-first, data-driven, unitary operating brand of S4Capital plc, where our culture centers on how we show up for the work and for one another. That begins with the commitment to strive for mastery—taking deep pride in our craft and creating work that sets the bar. In everyday execution, we drive momentum by choosing bold action rather than waiting for certainty. Above all, our teams are stronger together, bringing diverse perspectives into a unified team that communicates with clarity, trust, and mutual respect.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;This commitment to craft and innovation translates directly into widespread industry acclaim: Monks was named a Contender in The Forrester WaveTM: Global Marketing Services and a leader in the 2026 Gartner® Magic QuadrantTM for Global Digital Marketing Agencies. It ranks among Cannes Lions&#39; Top 10 Creative Companies (2022-25) and remains the only partner featured in AdExchanger’s Programmatic Power Players list every year (2020-24). Named Adweek’s first AI Agency of the Year (2023) and The One Show’s inaugural AI Pioneer Organization (2025), Monks was also awarded Business Intelligence Group’s 2026 Excellence in Artificial Intelligence Award in the Human-Machine Interaction Team category. Additionally, Monks.Flow earned AI-based Marketing Solution of the Year at the 2026 AI Breakthrough Awards and a 2026 Global Generative AI Award in the Agentic Marketing Innovation category. Finally, Monks achieved a record-breaking number of FWAs and continues to hold the most of any partner.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;We are an equal-opportunity employer committed to building a respectful and empowering work environment for all people to freely express themselves amongst colleagues who embrace diversity in all respects. Including fresh voices and unique points of view in all aspects of our business not only creates an environment where we can all grow and thrive but also increases our potential to produce work that better represents—and resonates with—the world around us.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who we are:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Burson, part of WPP, is the global communications leader built to create value for clients through reputation. With highly specialized teams, industry-leading technologies and breakthrough creative, we help brands and businesses redefine reputation as a competitive advantage so they can lead today and into the future. When you work at Burson, you are part of a global community of lifelong learners who thrive at the edge of innovation.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;WPP (LSE/NYSE: WPP) is the trusted growth partner for the world’s leading brands. We unite cutting-edge media intelligence and data solutions, world-class creativity, next-generation production, transformative enterprise solutions and expert strategic counsel in a single company – powered by exceptional talent and our agentic marketing platform, WPP Open, to help our clients navigate change, capture opportunity and deliver transformational growth. For more information, visit &lt;a href=&quot;WPP.com&quot;&gt;WPP.com&lt;/a&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;For more information visit&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.bursonglobal.com/&quot;&gt;bursonglobal.com&lt;/a&gt; and follow us on &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.linkedin.com/company/burson/posts/?feedView=all&quot;&gt;LinkedIn&lt;/a&gt; and&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.instagram.com/burson.global/?hl=en&quot;&gt;Instagram&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 14pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Quem somos:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;A Burson é líder global em comunicação estratégica, focada em construir e fortalecer a reputação de seus clientes para gerar valor. Com equipes altamente especializadas, tecnologias de ponta e mentes criativas e inovadoras, ajudamos marcas e empresas a transformar sua reputação em uma vantagem competitiva duradoura. Ao se juntar à Burson, você integrará uma comunidade global de profissionais em constante aprendizado, que prosperam na vanguarda da inovação.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Burson faz parte da WPP (LSE/NYSE: WPP), a empresa de transformação criativa. Para mais informações, visite &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.bursonglobal.com/&quot;&gt;bursonglobal.com&lt;/a&gt; e siga-nos no &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.linkedin.com/company/burson/posts/?feedView=all&quot;&gt;LinkedIn&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.instagram.com/burson.global/?hl=en&quot;&gt;e Instagram&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 14pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Mais sobre a posição:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Estamos formando um banco de talentos para profissionais de&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;Relações Governamentais e Public Affairs&lt;/strong&gt;,&amp;nbsp;com oportunidades que vão desde posições de nível Júnior até Gerenciais. Se você deseja fazer parte de uma das maiores agências globais, atuando em projetos de grande impacto para marcas reconhecidas mundialmente, em um ambiente dinâmico, inovador e colaborativo, queremos conhecer você!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 14pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;O que você fará:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Colaborar no desenvolvimento de estratégias de relações institucionais e governamentais;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Acompanhar discussões, projetos e ações nos Poderes Executivo e Legislativo;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Participar de reuniões e atividades presenciais com clientes, agentes públicos e organizações privadas, além de acompanhar audiências e eventos;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Estabelecer contato com representantes dos Poderes Executivo e Legislativo nos níveis federal, estadual e municipal;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Analisar informações e estruturar relatórios estratégicos para os clientes;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Preparar apresentações em PowerPoint, relatórios em Word e tabelas em Excel, em português e inglês;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Elaborar relatórios de resultados, indicadores e análises detalhadas;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Colaborar e interagir com a equipe diariamente.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 14pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Experiência que contribui para o sucesso:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Residência em Brasília, DF&lt;/strong&gt;;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;Graduação completa em Relações Internacionais, Ciência Política, Economia, Direito, Administração ou áreas correlatas;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;Desejável pós-graduação/MBA em Relações Governamentais, Políticas Públicas ou áreas relacionadas;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;Experiência prévia em Relações Governamentais e/ou Public Affairs, preferencialmente em consultoria;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;Inglês avançado (essencial);&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;Domínio do Pacote Office (nível avançado);&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;Disponibilidade para início imediato.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 14pt;&quot;&gt;Benefícios:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;VR/VA _ cartão flexível (R$50,00 por dia);&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Assistência Médica;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Assistência Odontológica;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;TotalPass&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Seguro de Vida;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Day Off no aniversário;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Um short day por mês;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Horário flexível e modelo híbrido de trabalho.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;#LI-LS2&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Você pertence a Burson:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Nossa visão é que a Burson seja a principal &#39;empresa acadêmica&#39; para profissionais de comunicação criativa e líderes emergentes. Oferecemos um ambiente dinâmico e estimulante, onde talentos ambiciosos aprimoram suas habilidades, expandem suas redes e criam as melhores soluções para marcas líderes. Nosso compromisso com o seu desenvolvimento se reflete em programas robustos de benefícios e desenvolvimento de pessoas, incluindo oportunidades de crescimento profissional, mentoria com líderes do setor, uma cultura vibrante e inclusiva que fomenta a colaboração e a inovação, e pacotes de remuneração e benefícios competitivos para atrair e reter os melhores talentos. Investimos em nossos colaboradores porque acreditamos que o sucesso deles é fundamental para o nosso sucesso.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Na Burson, valorizamos o aprendizado contínuo. Entendemos que a excelência em criatividade e comunicação exige um profundo conhecimento e compreensão diferenciada. Por isso, buscamos ativamente talentos excepcionais de diversas origens e identidades. Essa diversidade é essencial para inspirar ideias ousadas, promover diálogos construtivos, criar experiências significativas e impulsionar a inovação para nossos clientes. Seu ponto de vista único – seu talento – é o que define uma #BursonPerson e nos permite, juntos, entregar resultados excepcionais.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Ao clicar em &quot;Enviar inscrição&quot;, você compartilhará as informações fornecidas com a Burson. Recomendamos que você leia nossa &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.bursonglobal.com/p/recruitment-privacy-notice&quot;&gt;Política de Privacidade de Recrutamento&lt;/a&gt; antes de prosseguir. Residentes da Califórnia devem consultar também o Aviso de Privacidade de &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.bursonglobal.com/p/california-recruitment-privacy-notice&quot;&gt;Recrutamento da Califórnia&lt;/a&gt;. Esses documentos explicam como utilizamos seus dados pessoais durante o processo seletivo, como você pode atualizá-los ou solicitá-los sua exclusão.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You belong at Burson:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our vision is for Burson to be the leading ‘academy company’ for creative communications professionals and emerging leaders. We provide a dynamic environment where ambitious colleagues come to elevate their skills, expand their networks, and ultimately, produce the best solutions for today’s leading brands. Our commitment to your growth is reflected in our robust benefits and people programs, which include professional development opportunities, mentorship programs with industry leaders, a vibrant and inclusive company culture fostering collaboration and innovation and packages designed to reward and retain top talent. We invest in our people because we believe their success is our success.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Burson, we’re an agency of learn-it-alls. We recognize that the things we do best, creativity and communications, require a level of nuanced understanding. That’s why it’s imperative for us to hire extraordinarily talented people of all backgrounds and identities. Without that we can’t do the essential work of inspiring bold ideas, fostering constructive dialogue, cultivating meaningful experiences, and driving innovation and creativity for our partners. Your unique point of view—your talent—is what makes you a #BursonPerson, and it’s how we deliver exceptional results for our clients, together.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We believe the best work happens when we&#39;re together, fostering creativity, collaboration, and connection. That&#39;s why we’ve adopted a hybrid approach, with teams in the office around four days a week. If you require accommodations or flexibility, please discuss this with the hiring team during the interview process.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;When you click the &quot;Submit Application&quot; button below, this will send any information you add below to Burson. Before you do this, we think it&#39;s a good idea to read through our &amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.bursonglobal.com/p/recruitment-privacy-notice&quot;&gt;Recruitment Privacy Policy. &lt;/a&gt;California residents should read our  &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.bursonglobal.com/p/california-recruitment-privacy-notice&quot;&gt;California Recruitment Privacy Notice. &lt;/a&gt;This explains what we do with your personal data when you apply for a role with us, and, how you can update the information you have provided us with or how to remove it.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who we are&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Stripe&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Stripe is a financial infrastructure platform for businesses. Millions of companies—from the world’s largest enterprises to the most ambitious startups—use Stripe to accept payments, grow their revenue, and accelerate new business opportunities. Our mission is to increase the GDP of the internet, and we have a staggering amount of work ahead. That means you have an unprecedented opportunity to put the global economy within everyone’s reach while doing the most important work of your career.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the team&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;The Platform Sales team works with B2B Software Platforms to help them facilitate payments for their customers using our Stripe Connect product. Software Platforms, also known as B2B Indirect, are software platform businesses who serve other businesses. Platforms already using Stripe include Shopify, Lightspeed, and Mindbody.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;As a key member of the Stripe Platforms team, you will manage and elevate relationships with a named account list while identifying new growth opportunities and ways Stripe can exceed expectations.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;If you’re motivated, smart, persistent, and a great teammate, we want to hear from you.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;As an Account Executive (Existing Business), you will create partnerships between Stripe and the most innovative and fastest-growing software platforms in the world by helping them to understand how Stripe’s online commerce infrastructure can make payments a competitive advantage for their businesses.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Directly manage and nurture a named account list and develop account plans for winning and expanding business with enterprise companies&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build and maintain key relationships with C-level executives, while orchestrating the right executive touch points as well&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Contribute to shaping our platform partnership strategy and building repeatable processes and scaled engagement models&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Develop outbound strategies to create and nurture opportunities&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Own the full sales cycle from lead to close for enterprise companies&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Develop relationships with executive stakeholders at new and existing clients&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Work with company leaders from multiple functions (e.g., Engineering, Product, and Finance) to lead complex product workshops and financial analyses&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Lead and contribute to team projects to develop and refine our sales process&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Engage with Product and Engineering teams to help drive product strategy&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who you are&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;You are an adept salesperson and relationship manager capable of engaging in business-level and technical conversations at multiple levels of the organization, including the CTO, COO, and CFO. You have experience working with enterprise companies. You have an in-depth understanding of the buyer journey and can lead a complex, multi-party sale in a highly consultative manner. You are used to building value in competitive situations and enjoy working on products that require deep product understanding, combined with technical knowledge. You are naturally detail-oriented and enjoy digging into business models and helping customers quantify their investment decisions. You get excited about prospecting, and are capable of independently leading a sales cycle from start to finish. Finally, you enjoy building—you like to actively participate in the development of our sales process, the articulation of our value proposition, and the creation of key tools and assets.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;If you’re motivated, smart, persistent, and a great teammate, we want to hear from you.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Minimum requirements&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;10+ years of experience directly selling a technical product or service, preferably at an API-first company, with a track record of top performance&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;A proven track record of leading complex, multi-party sales from inception to close in a highly consultative manner, including negotiating bespoke commercial agreements&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Strong listening skills and the ability to understand complex technical problems and become a trusted resource for decision-makers across technology and finance organizations&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Excellent verbal, written, and presentation skills&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;A positive attitude and strong work ethic, with the ability to operate in a highly ambiguous environment&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Deep interest in technology, including financial technology infrastructure&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Fastidious approach to CRM hygiene and experience utilizing thorough sales forecasting metrics on a weekly and quarterly basis and communicating them in a succinct manner&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Hunter Douglas is the world’s leading manufacturer of window coverings and a major manufacturer of architectural products. We are a brand that you know and trust. With more than 100 years of innovation, we’ve defined our industry with proprietary products that deliver revolutionary style and functionality and can be found in millions of homes and commercial buildings globally.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are searching for candidates that are driven, intelligent, creative, and entrepreneurial. By offering challenging and accelerated opportunities for growth, powered by a shared hunger for success, we create a space for your career to thrive. In return for your expertise, we are committed to providing competitive and robust total compensation and benefit packages to ensure you feel valued. Our dream is to become the fastest growing, most loved, window covering company in the world. &lt;em&gt;What’s yours?&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Position Overview&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The Training Specialist focuses on delivering high-impact customer training through multiple modalities, including&amp;nbsp;video, eLearning, virtual instructor-led training (VILT), and in-person instruction (ILT). Leverages Adult Learning&amp;nbsp;Principles to transform SME-provided content into engaging, retention-focused learning experiences.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;In addition to facilitation support, this role requires expert-level content creation, particularly in video&amp;nbsp;production/editing and the design of web-based training.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Understands the business channels across Hunter Douglas and applies training solutions that support measurable&amp;nbsp;performance outcomes.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you&#39;ll do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Conduct needs analyses and partner with stakeholders to design training solutions aligned with Field Service&amp;nbsp;and installer-focused business objectives.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop high-quality training content, including instructional videos, eLearning modules, job aids, and&amp;nbsp;quick-reference guides, using industry-standard tools and creative techniques.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Facilitate training in a variety of formats (ILT, VILT, video-based learning, eLearning), ensuring learners can&amp;nbsp;apply concepts effectively.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify and track key metrics to evaluate learning effectiveness; use data to continuously improve training&amp;nbsp;content and delivery.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Stay current on training trends, technologies, and creative approaches to instructional media, and&amp;nbsp;incorporate new methods into training strategies.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Represent Hunter Douglas professionally when working with internal teams, dealers, and installers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage multiple projects simultaneously, adapting to shifting priorities and deadlines.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Travel 25–35% as required to support training initiatives.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who you are&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;High school diploma required. Bachelor&#39;s degree in Marketing, Business, Education, Training, or related&amp;nbsp;fields preferred.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;2-4 years in the window fashions industry, installation, training, photography, or video production&amp;nbsp;preferred.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;2+ years experience with in-person training delivery and facilitation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Extensive public speaking experience and commitment to continuous learning. · Bilingual English/Spanish highly desired.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Expert proficiency in video production and editing, including scripting, shooting, and post-production.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Expert ability to design and build web-based training/eLearning content using modern authoring tools.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong presentation and facilitation skills across diverse environments (video, live classroom, virtual&amp;nbsp;sessions).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to translate complex technical information into accessible, engaging content.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Use of Microsoft 365 including PowerPoint, Word, and Excel.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Solid Knowledge of: (programs, software, etc.)&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Training techniques, instructional design, and adult learning theory.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Technology platforms for content delivery (LMS, virtual platforms, media tools).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Grammar, writing, and editing for training content.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Project and time management, including coordinating multiple concurrent projects.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborative problem-solving and maintaining effective work relationships.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify and disseminate trends in data through Excel analysis.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What&#39;s in it for you?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Annual base salary range: $80000.00-$90000.00&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bonus target range: 10-20%&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Generous benefits package including medical, dental, vision, life, disability&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A company culture that prioritizes internal development and professional growth&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Time off with pay&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;401(k) plan with a degree of employer matching&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Paid parental leave&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Wellness programs and product discounts&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Please note, all offers presented to candidates are carefully crafted to ensure market competitiveness, equity, and reflect the individual candidate’s education, experience, skills and potential.&lt;br&gt;Hunter Douglas is an Equal Opportunity Employer and complies with applicable employment laws. EOE/M/F/Vet/Disabled are encouraged to apply.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(236, 240, 241);&quot;&gt;#LI-SA1&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(236, 240, 241);&quot;&gt;#L1 - ONSITE&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 8pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span data-olk-copy-source=&quot;MessageBody&quot;&gt;By submitting your application below, you are providing your prior consent to receive SMS messages to notify you of any updates to your application status and to engage in discussion throughout your application process. You can cancel the SMS service at any time. Just text “STOP” to any of our texts to unsubscribe. Message &amp;amp; data rates may apply. Message frequency may vary.&amp;nbsp;If you have any questions regarding privacy, please read our privacy policy,&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.hunterdouglas.com/privacy-policy&quot; data-auth=&quot;NotApplicable&quot; data-linkindex=&quot;15&quot;&gt;https://www.hunterdouglas.com/privacy-policy&lt;/a&gt;&amp;nbsp;or terms of use&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.hunterdouglas.com/terms-of-use&quot; data-auth=&quot;NotApplicable&quot; data-linkindex=&quot;16&quot;&gt;https://www.hunterdouglas.com/terms-of-use&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Please note that we will never request payment or bank account information at any stage of the recruitment process. As we continue to grow our teams, we urge you to be cautious of fraudulent job postings or recruitment activities that misuse our company name and information. Please protect your personal information during any recruitment process. While Monks may contact potential candidates via LinkedIn, all applications must be submitted through our official website (&lt;a class=&quot;c-link c-link--focus-visible&quot; href=&quot;http://monks.com/careers&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; data-stringify-link=&quot;http://monks.com/careers&quot; data-sk=&quot;tooltip_parent&quot;&gt;monks.com/careers&lt;/a&gt;).&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;In the Content Creator position you’ll be responsible for developing the social content.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This role provides a huge opportunity to redefine the category and create content that truly has impact. As a social-first creative you’ll need to craft ideas that demonstrate cultural relevance and will be responsible for the daily management of the local community and moderation of our brand&#39;s social channels, ensuring that our content resonates with local audiences and meets their needs.&lt;strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;In this role you will:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop and execute creative and engaging social media strategies in collaboration with strategy, creative teams and technology AI teams.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage the day-to-day handling of social media content across channels including Instagram and TikTok adapting content to suit different channels.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Spot social opportunities within wider creative ideas.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Use AI tools to propose and create social content.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop a monthly social editorial calendar and align with the wider content team.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Create content in-the-moment in response to social trends.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure legal compliance of content (e.g. copyright and data protection).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop innovative creative in response to client briefs, alongside identifying proactive opportunities to develop social content that will fulfill the brand objectives.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Present ideas comprehensively to clients and colleagues, confidently explaining and supporting your thinking.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Amend and redevelop content in response to feedback.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Understand performance metrics, and use them to inform future creative development.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Be responsible for the full creative funnel, from ideation to creation of social content.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Understand social platforms and trends in real time to trigger new ideas and proposals for campaigns.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Experience you already have:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A social native, active across a multitude of platforms.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrate passion for socially-led creative thinking.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;2+ years of proven work experience as a social-first creative for an agency / brand.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience of developing exciting social executions for brands.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Basic experience in the use of AI tools for creating scripts and visual content.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A keen eye on emerging social trends across platforms&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience of crafting reactive content in response to social trends.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working on brave, innovative brands, looking to push cultural boundaries.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A keen eye for visual details and accuracy.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A deep understanding of consumer behaviour, and adapting content plans to address the needs of the community.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A great team player, that can work hand to hand with tech areas.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience of basic camera work, editing and design &lt;strong&gt;is a bonus.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;#LI-SJ2 #LI-Hybrid&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Monks &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Monks is the global, digital-first, data-driven, unitary operating brand of S4Capital plc, where our culture centers on how we show up for the work and for one another. That begins with the commitment to strive for mastery—taking deep pride in our craft and creating work that sets the bar. In everyday execution, we drive momentum by choosing bold action rather than waiting for certainty. Above all, our teams are stronger together, bringing diverse perspectives into a unified team that communicates with clarity, trust, and mutual respect.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;This commitment to craft and innovation translates directly into widespread industry acclaim: Monks was named a Contender in The Forrester WaveTM: Global Marketing Services and a leader in the 2026 Gartner® Magic QuadrantTM for Global Digital Marketing Agencies. It ranks among Cannes Lions&#39; Top 10 Creative Companies (2022-25) and remains the only partner featured in AdExchanger’s Programmatic Power Players list every year (2020-24). Named Adweek’s first AI Agency of the Year (2023) and The One Show’s inaugural AI Pioneer Organization (2025), Monks was also awarded Business Intelligence Group’s 2026 Excellence in Artificial Intelligence Award in the Human-Machine Interaction Team category. Additionally, Monks.Flow earned AI-based Marketing Solution of the Year at the 2026 AI Breakthrough Awards and a 2026 Global Generative AI Award in the Agentic Marketing Innovation category. Finally, Monks achieved a record-breaking number of FWAs and continues to hold the most of any partner.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;We are an equal-opportunity employer committed to building a respectful and empowering work environment for all people to freely express themselves amongst colleagues who embrace diversity in all respects. Including fresh voices and unique points of view in all aspects of our business not only creates an environment where we can all grow and thrive but also increases our potential to produce work that better represents—and resonates with—the world around us.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Please note that we will never request payment or bank account information at any stage of the recruitment process. As we continue to grow our teams, we urge you to be cautious of fraudulent job postings or recruitment activities that misuse our company name and information. Please protect your personal information during any recruitment process. While Monks may contact potential candidates via LinkedIn, all applications must be submitted through our official website (&lt;a class=&quot;c-link c-link--focus-visible&quot; href=&quot;http://monks.com/careers&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; data-stringify-link=&quot;http://monks.com/careers&quot; data-sk=&quot;tooltip_parent&quot;&gt;monks.com/careers&lt;/a&gt;).&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;We are looking for a highly organized, &lt;strong&gt;detail-oriented Motion Designer&lt;/strong&gt; who finds as much beauty in a perfectly organized project file as they do in a smooth animation.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;In this role, your primary mission is to act as the architect of our visual output. You won’t just be creating videos; you will be building the engines that allow our global campaigns to live across dozens of languages and formats with surgical precision.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You are the bridge between high-end design and massive-scale execution. While you will develop original creative assets, your core focus is on the technical craft of &lt;strong&gt;localization, template architecture, and AI-driven automation&lt;/strong&gt; using the Google ecosystem.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Core Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Master Template Architecture:&lt;/strong&gt; Design and &quot;bulletproof&quot; complex After Effects templates. You will ensure that layouts, typography, and timings adapt intelligently to varying text lengths and localized content via Expressions and Essential Graphics.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Precision Localization:&lt;/strong&gt; Own the end-to-end technical rollout of global campaigns. You will ensure every regional variation is frame-perfect, managing the nuances of different languages and cultural formats with an obsessive eye for detail.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Workflow Automation:&lt;/strong&gt; Champion the use of AI-assisted tools to eliminate manual tasks. You will connect data feeds (Sheets/CSV) to creative templates to trigger high-volume renders with minimal manual intervention.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Asset Scaling &amp;amp; QA:&lt;/strong&gt; Maintain rigorous organizational standards across massive asset libraries. You are the final line of defense, ensuring that every export—regardless of the quantity—meets our exact technical and brand specifications.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Strategic Creative Development:&lt;/strong&gt; Design the foundational &quot;Hero&quot; motion assets that serve as the blueprint for our automated systems, ensuring they are built from the ground up for scalability.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Your Technical Mindset&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Architect:&lt;/strong&gt; You believe a project is only as good as its structure. You prioritize clean hierarchies, strict naming conventions, and scalable workflows.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Logic Specialist:&lt;/strong&gt; You have a deep command of &lt;strong&gt;After Effects Expressions&lt;/strong&gt; and scripting, using them to solve layout challenges before they occur.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Google Power-User:&lt;/strong&gt; You are comfortable navigating &lt;strong&gt;Google Workspace, &lt;/strong&gt;and leveraging &lt;strong&gt;Gemini/AI tools&lt;/strong&gt; to optimize creative production.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Detail Obsessed:&lt;/strong&gt; You are someone who naturally spots a 1-pixel misalignment or a slight tracking inconsistency across 100+ localized banners.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Experience &amp;amp; Qualifications&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;3–5 years of experience in an agency or fast-paced in-house creative team.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A portfolio demonstrating high-end motion work alongside examples of &lt;strong&gt;dynamic/programmatic&lt;/strong&gt; creative projects.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven track record of managing &quot;Creative at Scale&quot; (localizing content for multiple regions or AB testing).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A &quot;hacker&quot; mindset—always looking for a way to automate a repetitive task&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;An essential requirement is having advanced and conversational English.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
